{
  "file": "Guidance for national",
  "page": 53,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        36.0,
        21.884788513183594,
        63.09400177001953,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "Second",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        63.09400177001953,
        21.884788513183594,
        86.86299896240234,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "edition",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        83.1881103515625,
        513.4143676757812,
        96.53961181640625
      ],
      "text": "evidence also shows that the revised dosages have an excellent safety profile and are",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        99.18463134765625,
        510.2405700683594,
        112.5361328125
      ],
      "text": "not associated with an increased risk of toxicity (including no increased risk of drug-",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        115.18115234375,
        513.4718627929688,
        128.53265380859375
      ],
      "text": "induced hepatotoxicity due to isoniazid or pyrazinamide, or of optic neuritis due to",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        131.10867309570312,
        177.07391357421875,
        144.5291748046875
      ],
      "text": "(4, 5) ethambutol  ).",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        155.68414306640625,
        513.4474487304688,
        169.04364013671875
      ],
      "text": "The Panel considered recent pharmacokinetic data  showing that the serum levels  1",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        171.68865966796875,
        513.3899536132812,
        185.0401611328125
      ],
      "text": "achieved in infants and young children under 2 years of age using the dosages listed above",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        187.6851806640625,
        513.4705200195312,
        201.03668212890625
      ],
      "text": "were higher than those achieved in the same child with the previously recommended",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        203.61270141601562,
        508.2724609375,
        217.033203125
      ],
      "text": "(1) dosages. This is the most recent pharmacokinetic evidence to support the revisions .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        228.18817138671875,
        513.3900146484375,
        241.5396728515625
      ],
      "text": "The Panel then considered the ranges for isoniazid, where the lower end of the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        244.11569213867188,
        513.4705200195312,
        257.53619384765625
      ],
      "text": "(6) recommended dosage range   is the same as the actual recommended dosage of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        260.18121337890625,
        513.4706420898438,
        273.53271484375
      ],
      "text": "isoniazid (10 mg/kg). Because of the implementation difficulties this dosing presents,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        276.177734375,
        513.4705810546875,
        289.52923583984375
      ],
      "text": "the Panel considered recent pharmacokinetic data on isoniazid in young children and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        292.17425537109375,
        240.72488403320312,
        305.5257568359375
      ],
      "text": "recent analysis of existing data.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        316.68072509765625,
        513.4476318359375,
        330.0322265625
      ],
      "text": "The Panel noted the difficulties of implementing the 2010 recommended dosages",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        332.6772155761719,
        513.458984375,
        346.0287170410156
      ],
      "text": "using either currently available fixed-dose combinations (FDCs) or the FDC proposed",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        348.6737060546875,
        513.3668823242188,
        362.02520751953125
      ],
      "text": "for paediatric use in the future. The principal difficulty is that the recommended dosage",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        364.6701965332031,
        513.4703979492188,
        378.0216979980469
      ],
      "text": "for isoniazid in 2010 (10 mg/kg) was the same as the lower limit of the range (10-15",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        380.66668701171875,
        513.4475708007812,
        394.0181884765625
      ],
      "text": "mg/kg). Using an FDC of three essential drugs (rifampicin, isoniazid, pyrazinamide), for",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        396.6631774902344,
        510.27362060546875,
        410.0146789550781
      ],
      "text": "many children it would be impossible to provide an isoniazid dosage in the 10-15 mg/",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        412.65966796875,
        513.4130249023438,
        426.01116943359375
      ],
      "text": "kg range without using a pyrazinamide dosage that exceeded the recommended range",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        428.6561584472656,
        513.3899536132812,
        442.0076599121094
      ],
      "text": "(thereby increasing the risk of hepatotoxicity) or without requiring additional tablets of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        444.65264892578125,
        513.4015502929688,
        458.004150390625
      ],
      "text": "isoniazid alone (thereby imposing an additional pill burden and increasing the risk of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        460.6491394042969,
        169.81588745117188,
        474.0006408691406
      ],
      "text": "incorrect dosing).",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        485.0866394042969,
        513.4013061523438,
        498.50714111328125
      ],
      "text": "(1, 3) It was recognized - and supported by evidence   - that a minimal isoniazid dosage",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        501.1521301269531,
        513.4015502929688,
        514.503662109375
      ],
      "text": "of 7 mg/kg will provide adequate levels in almost all children. Even children who are",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03790283203125,
        517.1486206054688,
        513.4424438476562,
        530.555419921875
      ],
      "text": "younger than 2 years and/or are isoniazid fast acetylators  (the two subgroups most  2",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04440307617188,
        533.2003784179688,
        482.71453857421875,
        546.5518798828125
      ],
      "text": "likely to not reach optimal levels for drug action) will respond well to this dosage.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04440307617188,
        557.7069091796875,
        513.442626953125,
        571.0584106445312
      ],
      "text": "The Panel therefore recommended extending the isoniazid dosing range from 10-15",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04440307617188,
        573.7034301757812,
        361.7689208984375,
        587.054931640625
      ],
      "text": "mg/kg to 7-15 mg/kg, with the mid-range of 10 mg/kg.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04440307617188,
        598.2098999023438,
        513.4195556640625,
        611.5614013671875
      ],
      "text": "Table 3 shows the recommended doses and dose ranges for first-line anti-TB drugs;",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04440307617188,
        614.2064208984375,
        358.6470031738281,
        627.5579223632812
      ],
      "text": "these recommendations are independent of HIV status. 3",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        751.3140869140625,
        359.1124572753906,
        763.3140869140625
      ],
      "text": "Published after the 2010 Rapid advice: treatment of tuberculosis in children. 1",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        763.7487182617188,
        510.28076171875,
        775.7487182617188
      ],
      "text": "Children who are fast isoniazid acetylators metabolize anti-TB drugs more quickly and must therefore be given higher mg/ 2",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        99.21649932861328,
        773.3486938476562,
        360.7926025390625,
        785.3486938476562
      ],
      "text": "kg dosages in order to achieve adequate concentrations for anti-TB activity.",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        785.7833862304688,
        512.480712890625,
        797.7833862304688
      ],
      "text": "However, there are some interactions between anti-TB drugs and antiretrovirals.  See the “Antiretroviral therapy” section  3",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        99.21649932861328,
        795.3834228515625,
        394.25653076171875,
        807.3834228515625
      ],
      "text": "of Chapter 6 for details on customizing the regimen for the HIV- and TB-infected child.",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        14.202799797058105,
        805.8439331054688,
        36.44280242919922,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "34",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
}